    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu achigomba na Musa achimuamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hala feza uibande-bande na utengeze tarumbeta mbiri, ambazo undazihumira kuiha Aiziraeli osi phamwenga na kuvundza kambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tarumbeta zosi mbiri zichipigbwa chivyamwenga, atu osi andakusanyika mberezo pho phatu pha kumenyera hema ra mkpwutano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ichipigbwa mwenga bahi, phahi vilongozi a mbari za Iziraeli, andakusanyika mberezo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tarumbeta ndiphopigbwa mriro dza hura wa kuvundza kambi, mbari zirizochita kambi uphande wa mlairo wa dzuwa zindauka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uchipiga tsona kano ya phiri, mbari zirizochita kambi uphande wa mwakani zindauka. Tarumbeta ichipigbwa tsona chila wakati ambapho atu ni avundze kambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ichikala ni atu akusanyike phamwenga, mundapiga zo tarumbeta mriro tafwauti na hura wa kuvundza kambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tarumbeta hizo zindakala zichipigbwa ni ana a Aruni ario ni alavyadzi-sadaka. Hino indakala shariya kpwenu na vivyazi vyenu vyosi ta kare na kare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mndiphokala vihani kahi ya tsi yenu kupigana na maadui genu, mundapiga mriro dza hura wa kuvundza kambi, kpwa hata mtambukirwe ni Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu na mtivywe kula kpwa maadui genu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piya mundapiga zo tarumbeta wakati ndiphokala na raha, wakati wa sikukuu zenu zopangbwa na wakati wa kulumbwa kpwa mwezi. Mundapiga zo tarumbeta ndiphokala munalavya sadaka zenu za kuochwa na sadaka zenu za amani, nazo zindakala kpwenu ni ukumbusho mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu. Mimi, ndimi Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wenu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kahi ya siku ya mirongo miiri ya mwezi wa phiri ya mwaka wa phiri, ro ingu raunuka pho dzulu ya hema ra ushaidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Aiziraeli achiuka kula jangbwa ra Sinai na achiphiya phatu hadi phatu, hadi ro ingu ririphoima ko jangbwa ra Parani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho auka kpwa kano ya kpwandza kpwa lagizo ra Mwenyezi Mlungu kutsupira Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariokala a kpwandza kuvundza kambi kala ni makundi ga kambi ya Juda tsini ya bendera yao. Na chilongozi wa kundi ra mbari ya Juda kala ni Nashoni mwana wa Aminadabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chilongozi wa kundi ra mbari ya Isakari kala ni Nethaneli mwana wa Suari, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na chilongozi wa kundi ra mbari ya Zabuloni kala ni Eliabu mwana wa Heloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha ro hema ratserezwa, na atu a mryango wa Gerishoni na wa Merari aritsukula achiuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
