          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivi ndivyo higo makundi ga Aiziraeli garivyovundza kambi na kuuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Musa achigomba na mlamuwe Hobabu yekala mwana wa mtsedzawe Reueli, Mmidiani achimuamba, “Swiswi hunaphiya ko kpwatu ambako Mwenyezi Mlungu waamba, ‘Nindakuphani,’ ndzo huphiye naswi, naswi hundakuhendera manono, mana Mwenyezi Mlungu akaahidi manono kpwa Iziraeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Hobabu achimjibu achimuamba, “Mino sindaphiya, ela nindauya kpwehu, kpwa mbari zangu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Musa achimuamba, “Hunakuvoya usihuriche, mana uwe ndiwe umanyaye phatu hunaphoweza kuchita kambi jangbwani, nawe undahuelekeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona, uchiphiya phamwenga naswi, nono rorosi ambaro Mwenyezi Mlungu andahuendera, naswi undakuhendera dza vivyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.10.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
